    "Keep track of what you want to watch, find where it's streaming, and get told the moment it lands." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Behalte im Blick, was du sehen willst, finde heraus, wo es läuft, und erfahre sofort, wenn es da ist."
