    "Save anything you come across and we'll tell you when it airs or lands on a service you have." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Merk dir alles, was dir begegnet – wir sagen dir Bescheid, wenn es läuft oder bei einem deiner Dienste erscheint."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Αποθήκευσε ό,τι πετύχεις και θα σε ειδοποιήσουμε όταν βγει ή όταν έρθει σε υπηρεσία που έχεις."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Guarda lo que te llame la atención y te avisaremos cuando se estrene o llegue a una de tus plataformas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enregistrez tout ce qui vous tente et nous vous préviendrons dès que c’est diffusé ou disponible sur l’un de vos services."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salve o que encontrar pelo caminho e avisamos quando estrear ou chegar a um dos seus serviços."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save or like %lld more titles and Movie Coach will start telling you whether something's a good fit for you." : {
      "comment" : "Movie Coach progress card. The number is how many more titles the user needs.",
